The Poly Haven logo (polyhaven-icon.svg) is a trademark of Poly Haven.
It is used under the permission stated in Poly Haven's API terms
(https://polyhaven.com/our-api), which explicitly allow products built on
their API to use the logo. Its presence in the Polyhaven tab does not
imply affiliation or endorsement; the tab also satisfies their
attribution requirement for API usage.

