The ambientCG logo (ambientcg-icon.svg) is a trademark of ambientCG
(Lennart Demes). It is the monochrome icon mark published at
docs.ambientcg.com/brand, which explicitly allows using the ambientCG
logo "to represent or reference ambientCG" as long as no endorsement or
affiliation is implied. Its presence in the ambientCG tab is exactly
that — a reference to the asset provider; the name is spelled
"ambientCG" per the brand guide.
